<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/public-nav') %>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="tagline">Your Knowledge, ORGANIZED.</p>
        <h1>One workspace for everything<br/>you're learning.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          StudySelf AI is an intelligent personal knowledge workspace. Organize study
          material into Books and Topics, chat with an AI tutor inside each one, then
          quiz yourself, find your weak spots, and revise exactly what matters —
          instead of scrolling through scattered chats and PDFs before an exam.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create your workspace</a>
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">I have an account</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">An Intelligent Personal Knowledge Workspace</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mock-book">
          <div class="mock-book-head">
            <span class="mock-folder">▤</span>
            <div>
              <div class="mock-book-title">Artificial Intelligence</div>
              <div class="mock-book-meta">Book · Created 2026</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="mock-topics">
            <li><span>Machine Learning</span><em>Strong</em></li>
            <li><span>Neural Networks</span><em class="warn">Revise</em></li>
            <li><span>NLP</span><em>Strong</em></li>
            <li><span>Computer Vision</span><em class="warn">Revise</em></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-quiz">
          <div class="mock-quiz-row"><span>Quiz score</span><strong>82%</strong></div>
          <div class="mock-bar"><span style="width:82%"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-band">
      <p>
        Most students end up with AI answers in one place, PDFs in another, and notes
        somewhere else entirely. StudySelf AI keeps the conversation, the source
        material, and the revision plan for every topic together — inside the same Book.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="features">
      <h2>Everything a topic needs, in one place</h2>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Books &amp; Topics</h3>
          <p>Organize study material like folders — a Book per subject, Topics inside it, sorted and easy to find again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>AI Chat, in context</h3>
          <p>Ask questions inside a Topic. The AI stays focused on what you're studying and keeps the history for later.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Show Subheadings</h3>
          <p>Turn a long conversation into a quick outline — Introduction, Definition, Types, Examples — for fast revision.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Quizzes that know you</h3>
          <p>Generate quizzes from your own content, then get a weakness breakdown instead of just a score.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Revision Queue</h3>
          <p>Weak topics are prioritized automatically — High, Medium, Low — so you know what to study next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Flashcards &amp; Study Map</h3>
          <p>Flip through AI-generated flashcards and see how your topics connect in a visual map.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>PDF → Book</h3>
          <p>Upload a PDF and StudySelf AI extracts the text and organizes it into Topics automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Progress Dashboard</h3>
          <p>Real numbers from your own activity — books, topics, quiz scores, and revision progress over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-index">1</span>
          <h4>Create a Book</h4>
          <p>Start a Book for a subject, or upload a PDF and let StudySelf AI build one for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-index">2</span>
          <h4>Add Topics &amp; chat</h4>
          <p>Break the Book into Topics and ask the AI tutor to explain, simplify, or summarize each one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-index">3</span>
          <h4>Quiz yourself</h4>
          <p>Take a quiz on one Topic or the whole Book, and see exactly which concepts need more work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-index">4</span>
          <h4>Revise what's weak</h4>
          <p>Your Revision Queue prioritizes weak Topics automatically, so exam prep stays focused.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-band">
        <div>
          <h3>Ready to organize what you're learning?</h3>
          <p>It only takes a minute to create your first Book.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started Free</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">S</span>
      <span class="brand-text">StudySelf <em>AI</em></span>
    </div>
    <p>An Intelligent Personal Knowledge Workspace — Your Knowledge, ORGANIZED.</p>
    <p class="footer-fine">A student mini project built with Node.js, Express, EJS, and MySQL.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
